                  "metadata": {
                    "mechanics": "Provides 5 Armor points. This armor allows the wearer to call \"No Effect, Helscape Suit\" to any targeted non-damage environmental effects while inside specific Zones of Mechanics such as Corrupted Morgues and certain disease-based scenarios. One 'use' of this item is expended to allow it to function for one trip through such a Zone of Mechanics. The ZoM will specify if a Helscape Suit is effective within it.\n\nAt armor creation, you may choose to expend 3 Rare Scrap to increase the armor value by 5 points. This may only be done once.  \n\nRequires 30% armor coverage, 40% if increased by adding additional Scrap.",
